                    <p class="rd-testimonial-text">"Great drinks and delicious nachos by the pool. Very relaxed atmosphere."<br>- Mark B.</p>
                    <div class="rd-testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
                </div>
                <div class="rd-testimonial-card">
                    <p class="rd-testimonial-text">"Friendly bartenders and nice music. A perfect spot to rest after swimming."<br>- Hannah K.</p>
                    <div class="rd-testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
